      "side": 1,
      "message": "If this class is not to be used directly, can you make it abstract? That would also allow you to get rid of the boolean. Something like:\n\n    abstract class BaseServingState extends State {\n\n        protected abstract boolean handleNewPrefixRequest(@NonNull IpPrefix currentPrefix);\n\nbut also see suggestions right below.",
      "range": {
        "startLine": 1179,
        "startChar": 4,
        "endLine": 1179,
        "endChar": 9
      },
      "revId": "1df3bab29fcda1fae6491c610554a3283695116a",
