      "message": "We could call it mDesiredInterfaceState (or mDesiredServingState) and use STATE_TETHERED and STATE_LOCAL_ONLY.\n\nIf you did that, then you could change LocalHotspotState#enter and TetheredState#enter to do:\n\n    sendInterfaceState(mDesiredServingState);\n\nYou could even move LocalHotspotState#enter and TetheredState#enter to BaseServingState#enter, because they would be identical except for the log line.",
