      "message": "Why this if? Can\u0027t we just always pass the scope in from the caller and get rid of isUseSapAndLohsConcurrently()? It means that the LOHS and wifi tethering on a given device will get different IP addresses but I think that\u0027s fine. Apps can\u0027t depend on the values of these addresses anyway, because we randomize them on every boot...",
