        "id": 1000835
      },
      "writtenOn": "2023-05-18T08:28:23Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "This is not an internet address. Those are global and these are private.\n\nIn fact, why have these constants at all? Can we just use the CONNECTIVITY_SCOPE_xxx constants? In fact, I\u0027d modify the code to make the caller pass in those constants instead of using an isLocalOnly boolean.",
