      "writtenOn": "2023-05-18T05:49:43Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "This naming is not clear. IIUC `mType` is the downstream type, while `mExtendType` is the upstream type. If that\u0027s accurate, why not `mDownstreamType` and `mUpstreamType` ?",
      "range": {
        "startLine": 409,
        "startChar": 0,
        "endLine": 410,
        "endChar": 38
