        "id": 1000835
      },
      "writtenOn": "2023-05-18T08:28:23Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "If I\u0027m reading the code correctly, then mType is the tethering type, so I think mType is a reasonable name. Elsewhere, this file uses interfaceType, so perhaps mTetheringType or mInterfaceType would be better?\n\nmExtendType is the connectivity scope so should probably be called mScope.",
      "parentUuid": "8554a047_2a0f0336",
